From: Jonas Salo <salomannen1234@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: add capability-gated Plus Key entry

Show the entry on every product that ships the privileged PlusKey system app,
without checking a device codename or model.

Co-Authored-By: Ren Hiyama <renhiyama@rovelstars.com>
---

